WEBVTT

00:20:59.846 --> 00:21:01.822
Special Operations Command down at Tampa.

00:21:01.846 --> 00:21:04.846
Trigger-pullers go this way.

00:21:05.846 --> 00:21:08.822
Civil Affairs, that bastard
child, comes over here.

00:21:08.846 --> 00:21:10.822
Return to the Army.

00:21:10.846 --> 00:21:14.037
The point about the trigger-pullers
and Special Operations Command.

00:21:14.061 --> 00:21:16.157
No off season, these
guys are always active.

00:21:16.846 --> 00:21:22.822
They drop in, do
their business, disappear.

00:21:22.846 --> 00:21:24.822
See me now. Don't talk about it later.

00:21:24.846 --> 00:21:28.822
(Laughter)

00:21:28.846 --> 00:21:30.822
I was never here.